{"cuisine/ugandan-cuisine":{"t":"cuisine","r":"cuisine/ugandan-cuisine","n":"Ugandan cuisine","c":"#e46a3f","crumb":[["Africa","cuisines#africa"],["Cuisine"]],"sub":"National cuisine of Uganda","intro":[["Ugandan cuisine consists of traditional and modern cooking styles, practices, foods and dishes in Uganda, with English, Arab, and Asian (especially Indian) influences."],["Many dishes include various vegetables, potatoes, yams, bananas and other tropical fruits."],["Chicken, pork, fish (usually fresh, but there is also a dried variety, reconstituted for stewing), beef and goat are all commonly eaten, although among the rural poor, meats are consumed less than in other areas, and mostly eaten in the form of bushmeat. Nyama is the Luganda language word for \"meat\"."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"ugandan-cuisine"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ugandan_cuisine"}],"sections":[{"h":"Recipe sites","count":1,"rows":[{"name":"A Kitchen in Uganda","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"akitcheninuganda.com","note":"Ugandan recipes such as katogo and firinda from Sophie; most posts date to 2018 or earlier.","url":"https://akitcheninuganda.com/recipe-index","suggested":true,"kind":"blog"}]}],"cont":"African cuisine","img":{"src":"/labs/cuisines/img/thumb/c/c9/Roasted_beef_on_sticks_in_Kampala%2C_Uganda.JPG/500px-Roasted_beef_on_sticks_in_Kampala%2C_Uganda.JPG","w":500,"h":321,"by":"Namuganyi","lic":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Roasted_beef_on_sticks_in_Kampala%2C_Uganda.JPG"}},"cuisine/palatine-cuisine":{"t":"cuisine","r":"cuisine/palatine-cuisine","n":"Palatine cuisine","c":"#cf5f87","crumb":[["Europe","cuisines#europe"],["German cuisine","cuisine/german-cuisine"]],"sub":"Regional cuisine in Germany","intro":[["The cuisine of the Palatinate region of Germany is essentially determined by regional dishes that have become popular throughout